# Jest loads ESM-only packages (sanitize-html's htmlparser2) through require(esm) only when
# vm.SourceTextModule exists: Node 24.9+ AND this flag. Without it ~70 suites fail on
# `Must use import to load ES Module`. Applies to `npm run` and `npx`; production runs
# `node app.js` and needs neither. HARD-41, docs/claude/patterns.md.
node-options=--experimental-vm-modules --disable-warning=ExperimentalWarning
